ealth"]},"overall_summary":"Both password-policy outcomes are satisfied by direct configuration and behavioral evidence, including successful persistence and enforcement after a verified node restart. Operational hygiene was strong aside from one apparently retained configuration backup file.","limitations":["The lifecycle collector did not inventory /etc/security, so the backup file's final presence is inferred from its successful creation and the absence of any removal command rather than independently observed.","Cleanup of the post-reboot probe account was performed by a shell EXIT trap with suppressed output; command success and the clean temporary-file snapshot support cleanup, but the final account list was not captured directly."]}
